                                                                            <h3 class="homepage-grid-caption no-padding overlay-green"><a href="http://www.undergraduate.rsmas.miami.edu/"><span>Undergraduate Studies</span></a></h3>
                                                                        </div>
       
            <div class="gateway-grid-content large-black small-black stagsanslight">With <strong>6 majors</strong> and many specialty areas to choose from, our degree programs in <strong>marine science</strong>, <strong>meteorology</strong>, <strong>geology</strong>, <strong>oceanography</strong>, <strong>marine biology and ecology</strong>, and <strong>marine affairs</strong> will prepare you for an exciting environmental career.</div> 
